debrief = PackedStringArray("event:wrong_variable guilty: So. About the gravity thing.", "event:wrong_variable guilty: Let's never speak of it.", "died guilty: Ouch. That one's on me.", "won happy: All of them. Made it.", "stopped happy: Gravity's back. Good enough.", "hit_none proud: You didn't even get hit. Show-off.")
